    <briefdescription>
<para>This structure describes how to handle film grain synthesis in video for specific codecs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Must be present on every frame where film grain is meant to be synthesised for correct presentation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The struct must be allocated with <ref refid="film__grain__params_8h_1aee530d6c32f0f0f0e121eb8ff0dfe55b" kindref="member">av_film_grain_params_alloc()</ref> and its size is not a part of the public ABI. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
